# Implementation Plan - UX Design Refinement

We will refine the visual and interactive experience using advanced UX principles. The goal is to move beyond a basic layout into a high-end "Editorial" experience with layered glassmorphism, choreographed transitions, and professional mathematical typography.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> To create an "Editorial" feel, I will implement **Layered Shadows**. Instead of one flat shadow, UI elements will use multiple shadow steps to create perceived depth on the pure black canvas.

> [!TIP]
> I will add **Layout Transition Logic**. When you toggle the sidebar, the mathematical graph will smoothly "slide" to stay perfectly centered in the remaining whitespace, preventing sudden jumps.

